  "sourceAudit": {
    "mechanism": "Standard-object common EED name resolution previously used editable APPID table values and synthesized fallback names, without immutable source name bytes/profile/decode history. Equal names or a bitwise issue-mask delta did not prove source fidelity.",
    "method": "Local source audit and generated adversarial controls; no pre-fix executable failure run is claimed for the new APIs."
  },
  "implemented": [
    "DRW_AppId retains private shared-const consumed source-name bits/start/count, decoded spelling, handle, version/effective codec and isolated field decode issues under a512KiB logical-owner cap.",
    "Name observation resets/restores the aggregate around the field, preserving repeated identical prior issues and earlier common-field events; unknown/unavailable/aliased/unspecified legacy profiles remain observed even for empty/ASCII values.",
    "Name profile eligibility requires the existing fixed APPID type67, a DWG/version-bound codec and complete declared TV/TU-width consumption; clean partial byte-length decoding does not qualify.",
    "Copy/assignment shares immutable name source; public name/handle mutation cannot refresh it; reset and failed parse clear it. Ordinary tolerant text/wire layout is unchanged.",
    "Converter callback snapshots are generation-keyed and closed at import completion, separate from editable rows, sharing standard64MiB/combined100000-record caps. Basic-table copying charges the extra name-source owner.",
    "Per-frame unique APPID dependency IDs are frozen under existing byte/item bounds; source name issues/profile uncertainty transfer into raw-frame observations without qualifying synthetic/missing/authored/unbound names.",
    "Same-generation APPID/object source handle collisions reject in both callback orders without a second source identity.",
    "Export checks referenced current rows against immutable callback/field owners before output and at final publication, refusing changed/missing/duplicate/replaced name sources atomically while preserving corrected same-adapter retries.",
    "Actual literal APPID records replace hand-filled names in the existing source-EED observation positives; new native controls retain original four modern modeled facts/zero legacy facts without import-retention promotion."
  ],
